{
  "comment": "A realisation, not a new profile: Credential Commons stays airy — this is an ordinary micro-credential that FILLS the neutral `level` slot with a monumental framework (EQF). The level references the official EU EQF concept URI, so it is Europass/ELM-ready out of the box. Swap the URI for a national NQF (or drop level entirely) and it is still conformant — CC mandates none.",
